ty, migration opportunities, and downstream trajectories even though complete-year background survival preserves the configured annual probability. Condition-death attribution also loses the former first-call priority in dual-trigger cases. The snapshot freezes synthetic verification outputs and is not calibration evidence or an empirical anthropological claim."}
